## Reviewer points not applied (disagreements)

- a#5. The URL is pcode G0340028, flno=3, the Business Tax Act (營業稅法). English 001 labels that same URL „General Business Tax Rate“. English 004 labels it article 10 of that act. Bulgarian 001’s label „ставка на данъка при източника върху дивиденти към нерезиденти“ is a mislabel of the business-tax link; the dividend withholding link in the same list is the eTax portal URL. The suggested dividend wording was not copied onto 004. „член 10“ was also left, so the source digit stays. 001’s own mislabel was not a flagged row and was not changed.
- Space as the thousands separator, and moving „TWD“ after the amount in that same suggested form (a#19, b#15, and the verdict pattern). The checker and R14 keep the dot. Decimal comma stays („0,5“).
- Reformatting `TWD 1.57M` to „1,57 млн. TWD“ (a#8). Pinned.
- Replacing Hangul `url` values (a#32). R16. The verdict already says not to edit them.
- Deleting the 008 „Трудност“ row (a#30). A table row cannot be removed. The cells were rephrased so economic dismissal and resignation are not an easy outcome, and the next row still says whether severance is owed.
- Merging the one-clause paragraphs in 013 and 015 (b#35 and the blog-padding pattern). Block counts stay. The chatty 003 close and the 008 greeting were rephrased inside their blocks.
- 010 already glosses ROC year 109 with „(2020 г.)“. That Gregorian year was not added in this lane. The checker’s extra-number WARN on 2020 is pre-existing, as are the extra „1“ in 006 and the extra „2×2“ in 015, and the 수사미해석 WARNs. None of them fail the summary.

